      "id": "import_widget_16",
      "widget": "text",
      "configVersion": 1,
      "title": "Runbook",
      "text": "## Standard Operating Procedure\n\n1. **Observe** telemetry trends in the selected asset.\n2. _Investigate_ anomalies via linked Sensors.\n3. Decide on a mitigation using the Action panel.\n4. Act — submit a Work Order.\n\n> Reference: [Field Manual §4.2](#)\n\n`asset.id` is the primary key."
    },
